mFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI上线控制室系统，实现失控AI智能体35秒内主动阻断</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta发布轻量模型Muse Ember，推理性能对标Claude Haiku且成本降至三分之一</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2与Mythos 5.2，千个智能体八天构建操作系统</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团开源1.6万亿参数LongCat-2.5模型，长序列SFT单卡吞吐提升86%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6aa8d5c25bacf302439365a89bcfdc67.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">美团于11月10日正式开源LongCat-2.5模型，采用MIT协议支持商用。该模型为原生多模态架构，总参数量达1.6万亿，激活参数约480亿，支持百万级上下文，在复杂代码开发、Visual Coding及专业办公场景表现显著。技术上，模型采用视觉表征层与主干统一处理，视觉token支持离线缓存。推理端采用W4A4量化方案，结合FlatQuant优化MoE精度，并配合专用融合算子降低成本。针对国产AI加速器显存限制，美团通过FSDP双重分片与混合词表并行技术，使长序列SFT单卡吞吐量较DDP基线提升86%。此次开源旨在为万亿参数MoE模型的工程落地与国产算力适配提供参考，权重已上线HuggingFace，并同步开放API平台。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">个人版Gemini关联Google Workspace后，部分数据将面临人工审核</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a3c12a58c3ac5138d12d7a29b7b2971c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">个人版Gemini在关联Gmail与Google云端硬盘后，部分处理数据将面临人工审核。开发者测试显示，开启应用关联后，Gemini会在用户未明确要求时自动检索邮箱或网盘文件，并可能在回答中展示账单摘要、姓名及邮件片段。谷歌官方确认，经培训的服务提供商人员将对交互记录、邮件及文件摘要进行人工审核，旨在排查系统问题并改进服务。尽管谷歌采取了脱敏措施，如将交互记录与Google账号断开关联，但承认无法完全剔除所有个人信息。此外，若用户开启活动保存，相关数据可能被用于AI模型训练。谷歌建议用户在处理机密信息时保持谨慎，并可在Gemini应用活动设置中关闭保存功能，以防止个人数据被用于模型训练。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI上线控制室系统，实现失控AI智能体35秒内主动阻断</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dca20010e949e95e4476df4ec5a4dd37.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月10日正式上线名为“控制室”的系统，旨在通过主动阻断机制应对失控AI智能体风险。该系统要求所有智能体训练、评估及数据处理任务接入中央服务，研究员需申领唯一任务ID，推理引擎在执行前必须向控制室获取授权。一旦触发停止指令，控制室将拒绝后续推理请求，从而切断模型输出。目前，该机制从接收指令到彻底拦截任务的最长耗时为35秒，OpenAI正致力于将此延迟降至零。此外，所有前沿强化学习任务均已配备独立模型监控器，负责实时监测行为并触发警报。此举标志着AI行业对智能体风险的管控已从理论预案转向工程化落地，通过“AI监控AI”与人工急停开关的组合，有效提升了对高风险任务的实时干预能力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta发布轻量模型Muse Ember，推理性能对标Claude Haiku且成本降至三分之一</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d5b256fb8d19e8a800496f952486380f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta于11月10日正式推出轻量化模型Muse Ember，旨在提升复杂推理与智能体任务的执行效率。在Artificial Analysis榜单中，Muse Ember综合表现对标Claude Haiku 5.5，但在AutomationBench-AA业务工作流测试中以37.8分大幅领先Haiku的13.9分。该模型支持100万Token上下文窗口及51.2万Token输出，具备处理完整代码库及长文档的能力。作为原生多模态模型，Muse Ember可直接处理文本、图像、音频及视频，无需外挂其他模型。在定价方面，其输入成本为每百万Token 0.10美元，输出成本为0.50美元，仅为Haiku的三分之一。目前，该模型已通过Meta Model API、Google Cloud及Oracle Cloud上线，且</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic发布Claude Fable 5.2与Mythos 5.2，千个智能体八天构建操作系统</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d82d6648fad3cfa9d7fb3dd086c08fd4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于11月10日发布Claude Fable 5.2与Mythos 5.2双模型，在编码、推理、科研及网安领域实现全面进阶，输出速度提升30%，成本降低20%。在FrontierCode 2.0编码基准测试中，Fable 5.2以49.1%的得分超越GPT-6 Astra及Gemini 4 Carbon。在Humanity&#x27;s Last Exam多学科推理测试中取得74.2%得分，并在VIALS-AA科学视觉推理中以67%领先竞品。该模型展现了强大的长程协作能力，通过调度超过1000个AI智能体，在8天内从零构建出一套包含驱动、文件存储及窗口系统的可启动操作系统。在AA-3D 3D体验构建榜单中，Fable 5.2以1271分的Elo评分显著领先自家Sonnet 5.5与Opus 5.5，且领先</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
